"pan gaiff %type cynnwys ei olygu ym mhob modd ffurflen, a nodi sut y "
"caiff teclynnau ffurflen y maes eu harddangos ym mhob modd ffurflen."

msgid "Edit %label content type"
msgstr "Golygu cynnwys y math o %label"

msgid ""
"The content has either been modified by another user, or you have "
"already submitted modifications. As a result, your changes cannot be "
"saved."
msgstr ""
"Mae'r cynnwys naill ai wedi'i addasu gan ddefnyddiwr arall, neu rydych "
"chi eisoes wedi cyflwyno addasiadau. O ganlyniad, ni ellir cadw'ch "
"newidiadau."

msgid "Use field label: @display_label"
msgstr "Defnyddiwch label y maes: @display_label"

