"        <ul>\n"
"  "
"        <li>Alinio delwedd i’r chwith: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Alinio delwedd "
"i’r canol: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Alinio delwedd i’r dde: "
"<code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"       "
