"A backup checkpoint was not created because nothing has changed since "
"the \"{active}\" checkpoint was created."
msgstr ""
"Ni chafodd man gwirio wrth gefn ei greu oherwydd nad oes dim wedi "
"newid ers i’r man gwirio „{active}“ gael ei greu."

msgid ""
"File entity %name was imported, but the associated file (@path) was "
"not found."
msgstr ""
"Mewnforiwyd endid ffeil %name, ond ni chafwyd hyd i’r ffeil "
"gysylltiedig (@path)."

