msgid "Delete (token) URL"
msgstr "Dileu URL (token)"

msgid ""
"The URL that can used to delete the webform submission. The webform "
"must be configured to allow users to delete a submission using a "
"secure token."
msgstr ""
"Yr URL y gellir ei ddefnyddio i ddileu’r cofnod ffurflen we. Rhaid "
"ffurfweddu’r ffurflen we i ganiatáu i ddefnyddwyr ddileu cofnod gan "
"ddefnyddio tocyn diogel."

msgid "Allow deleting a submission using token"
msgstr "Caniatáu dileu cyflwyniad gan ddefnyddio tocyn"

