"Only webforms that are open to new submissions can be deleted using "
"the secure token."
msgstr ""
"Dim ond y ffurflenni gwe sydd wedi’u hagor ar gyfer ceisiadau newydd "
"y gellir eu dileu gan ddefnyddio’r tocyn diogelwch."

