msgid ""
"AJAX responder -- tools to make it easier for the server to handle "
"AJAX requests and tell the client what to do with them."
msgstr ""
"Ymatebydd AJAX — offer i wneud hi’n haws i’r gweinydd drin "
"ceisiadau AJAX a dweud wrth y cleient beth i’w wneud â nhw."

