"The phpinfo() function is disabled. See <a href=\":url\" "
"target=\"_blank\">PHP documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mae'r ffwythiant `phpinfo()` wedi'i analluogi. Gweler y <a "
"href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">ddogfennaeth PHP</a>."

msgid ""
"Display \"@display\" needs a selected search fields to work properly. "
"See the settings for the Entity Reference Revisions list format."
msgstr ""
"Mae angen maes(au) chwilio dethol arddangos „@display“ er mwyn "
"iddo weithio’n gywir. Gweler y gosodiadau ar gyfer y fformat Rhestr "
