"Choose which sitemaps are to be submitted to which search "
"engines.<br>Sitemaps can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Dewiswch pa fapiau gwefan i’w cyflwyno i ba beiriannau "
"chwilio.<br>Gellir ffurfweddu mapiau gwefan <a href=\"@url\">yma</a>."

