msgid ""
"Code Mirror is used to provide a text editor for YAML, HTML, CSS, and "
"JavaScript configuration settings and messages."
msgstr ""
"Defnyddir Code Mirror i ddarparu golygydd testun ar gyfer gosodiadau a "
"negeseuon cyfluniad YAML, HTML, CSS a JavaScript."

