msgstr "Mae angen yr endid ffynhonnell i rag-lenwi ffurflenion"

msgid "Form prepopulate source entity type"
msgstr "Ffurflen rhag-lenwi math o endid ffynhonnell"

msgid "Submission user columns"
msgstr "Colofnau defnyddwyr y cyflwyniad"

msgid "Always include private and restricted access elements."
msgstr "Cynnwys elfennau mynediad preifat a chyfyngedig bob amser."

msgid ""
"Below columns are displayed to users who can view previous submissions "
